{
  "inShort": "With no playable build or test results shown, the team is behind. What got done is unknown because the devlog supplies no evidence of the slice or five-player test. With Mia unconfirmed for two weeks, Alex alone confirms work toward the playable slice.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvkg08t8nxz8v55cyzd7",
      "text": "The public repository opens and matches the promised Godot demo collection. It supplies reference projects, not evidence of your playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvop08t9nxz8eq2wcl2h",
      "text": "The animated reference video remains done. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. Without watching it, the animated style reference could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvsb08tanxz8bbdrwz5d",
      "text": "The playtesting article opens and explains testing purposes and formats. It meets the reference task, but does not document your five-player test."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports five players testing the tide loop. No playtest document or downloadable build was supplied. That leaves both islands, the tide loop, co-op sailing and player findings unverified.",
    "The image labelled “The tide out” shows a mountain landscape. The linked video's title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. Neither demonstrates the reported tide test.",
    "Missing evidence is common and can be addressed within this checkpoint."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What did the five players reveal about sailing, tide readability and problems that stopped play?",
    "Can you publish the tested build, launch instructions and the playtest notes mentioned in the devlog?"
  ]
}

